  <data name="WhatEachServiceChargesNote" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>What each service charges. Cost is worked out from these at the moment you look, never stored with the usage — published prices change, and a figure baked into a release six months ago is a number that looks authoritative and is wrong. The values below are the list prices at the time this version was built; correct any that have moved. Rates are entered at the scale each vendor quotes them in, shown beside every row. A provider with no row here is counted as unpriced, not as free — only the rows marked local are genuinely free.</value>
    <comment>Note in AgentUsageView.</comment>
  </data>
