  <data name="CollectsPlayerStructureIdsNote" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Collects player-structure IDs from assets, contracts, industry jobs, market orders and wallet entries, then resolves each one's name, type, owner and position. Sweeps hourly; the public structure list is walked once a day for structures nobody here has visited. Rows our own assets identify as ships, containers or asset-safety wraps are removed rather than kept as unknown structures. Resolving needs esi-universe.read_structures.v1 and docking access, so a private structure stays unresolved — those are the ones worth describing by hand in the Structure Browser.</value>
    <comment>Note in BackgroundProcessesView.</comment>
  </data>
